WEBVTT

00:00:01.063 --> 00:00:02.864
Do you know about Season Fairies?

00:00:02.864 --> 00:00:09.404
They're tiny fairies that make
rainfall, snowfall, wind, and clouds...

00:00:09.404 --> 00:00:10.906
Can you believe that?

00:00:10.906 --> 00:00:12.305
Zzzz...

00:00:12.574 --> 00:00:14.276
Wake up, Sugar!

00:00:14.276 --> 00:00:15.402
I don't wanna!

00:00:15.744 --> 00:00:18.941
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:19.314 --> 00:00:22.181
Kuchibiru ni

00:00:22.317 --> 00:00:27.380
Namida no rouge

00:00:46.775 --> 00:00:50.211
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:50.345 --> 00:00:57.376
Ai nante, Shiritaku naiwa

00:01:01.289 --> 00:01:04.656
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:04.793 --> 00:01:07.694
Kuchibiru ni

00:01:07.829 --> 00:01:12.789
Namida no rouge

00:01:15.604 --> 00:01:19.233
Mokuyo ni

00:01:19.374 --> 00:01:22.207
Bara o kai

00:01:22.344 --> 00:01:26.144
Tegami o soete

00:01:30.085 --> 00:01:33.577
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:33.722 --> 00:01:36.486
Yume de au

00:01:36.591 --> 00:01:41.392
Anata wa yasashii

00:01:48.703 --> 00:01:50.170
Waffo!

00:01:51.506 --> 00:01:56.205
Guess what? I just became
a full-fledged Snow Fairy!

00:01:56.344 --> 00:01:57.679
Way to go, Sugar!

00:01:57.679 --> 00:01:59.514
Congratulations!

00:01:59.514 --> 00:02:02.818
Thank you! Thank you, everyone!

00:02:02.818 --> 00:02:08.723
Without any further ado, I will show you
just how amazing the full-fledged Sugar is!

00:02:29.911 --> 00:02:31.139
Saga!

00:02:33.014 --> 00:02:36.651
Congratulations, Sugar. You're
a Season Fairy now, aren't you?

00:02:36.651 --> 00:02:38.846
Saga!

00:02:39.054 --> 00:02:41.022
I have a celebration present for you.

00:02:42.624 --> 00:02:44.353
Waffo!

00:02:44.493 --> 00:02:49.164
It's a year's supply of waffles.
Eat as much as you want.

00:02:49.164 --> 00:02:51.462
Thank you!!

00:02:55.537 --> 00:02:57.505
I'm stuffed!

00:02:59.708 --> 00:03:03.166
I can't possibly eat all this...

00:03:17.359 --> 00:03:18.326
Oh, no!

00:03:24.633 --> 00:03:28.069
The most important thing is
to play with feeling.

00:03:28.069 --> 00:03:29.938
Now, let's begin with you, Salt.

00:03:29.938 --> 00:03:31.405
Yes, sir.

00:03:41.183 --> 00:03:44.019
Good. Next, Pepper.

00:03:44.019 --> 00:03:45.509
Yes, sir.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.887
Oh...

00:03:54.362 --> 00:03:57.854
Very good. You two
have improved greatly.

00:03:57.999 --> 00:04:00.297
This is all we'll do today.

00:04:01.069 --> 00:04:02.661
Thank you, sir.

00:04:03.371 --> 00:04:06.041
But, what happened to Sugar?

00:04:06.041 --> 00:04:08.343
She never showed up.

00:04:08.343 --> 00:04:10.834
Elder! Wait!!

00:04:11.379 --> 00:04:14.280
Sugar! Where have you been?

00:04:15.116 --> 00:04:17.209
Uh, l-I'm sorry.

00:04:17.352 --> 00:04:19.912
I... Um...

00:04:20.889 --> 00:04:24.791
I w-was cleaning my magic piccolo
and forgot what time it was...

00:04:25.093 --> 00:04:26.924
Do not lie!

00:04:28.296 --> 00:04:30.265
What is THIS?

00:04:30.265 --> 00:04:31.254
Oh!

00:04:34.636 --> 00:04:36.399
Silly girl!!

00:04:36.638 --> 00:04:40.775
I told you I would make time to
examine your magic practice today,

00:04:40.775 --> 00:04:43.678
and you show up late. Shame on you!

00:04:43.678 --> 00:04:46.977
Do you really want to become
a full-fledged Season Fairy?

00:04:48.383 --> 00:04:52.786
If you don't shape up, you won't become
a proud Snow Fairy like your mother!

00:04:52.954 --> 00:04:57.192
Your mother is the fairy world's
number one Snow Fairy.

00:04:57.192 --> 00:05:01.496
I'm sure I heard you say many times
that you wanted to be like her.

00:05:01.496 --> 00:05:03.898
Have you already forgotten your goal?

00:05:03.898 --> 00:05:05.233
No, sir.

00:05:05.233 --> 00:05:08.862
I'll practice. I promise!!

00:05:09.704 --> 00:05:13.808
I'm busy. I have something
important to do now.

00:05:13.808 --> 00:05:16.244
Practice magic by yourself.

00:05:16.244 --> 00:05:19.407
Uh, hey! Elder!

00:05:20.749 --> 00:05:22.751
Boy, did he tell you!

00:05:22.751 --> 00:05:26.388
-Ginger!
-G-Good day!
You can't blame him.
You were eating waffles.

00:05:26.388 --> 00:05:28.356
Please wait!

00:05:28.356 --> 00:05:31.359
Oh, well. Don't get so depressed about it.

00:05:31.359 --> 00:05:34.328
I'm sure Elder will
help us practice again.

00:05:35.797 --> 00:05:37.788
I'll try really hard.

00:05:38.033 --> 00:05:41.594
I'll try hard, and I'll become
a Snow Fairy like Mommy!

00:05:51.646 --> 00:05:52.781
Be quiet!

00:05:52.781 --> 00:05:54.816
What? You're interrupting me!

00:05:54.816 --> 00:05:57.185
No, you're interrupting ME!

00:05:57.185 --> 00:06:00.348
I'm practicing my magic, so there!

00:06:03.758 --> 00:06:06.928
You're playing worse than usual...

00:06:06.928 --> 00:06:08.896
That's not true!

00:06:14.402 --> 00:06:16.996
Hey, why are you so
excited about practicing?

00:06:17.572 --> 00:06:21.269
I'm trying hard to become
a full-fledged Snow Fairy,

00:06:21.409 --> 00:06:23.411
like my mommy.

00:06:23.411 --> 00:06:28.350
Your mother... Come to think of it,
your mother is also a Snow Fairy, right?

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:30.418
She's not just a Snow Fairy.

00:06:30.418 --> 00:06:33.955
My mommy is the number one
Snow Fairy in the whole fairy world!

00:06:33.955 --> 00:06:34.923
Wow...

00:06:34.923 --> 00:06:41.954
She is special. The other Snow
Fairies all want to be like her!

00:06:45.667 --> 00:06:47.828
The snow she makes...

00:06:48.636 --> 00:06:53.437
...is very quiet and gentle
and warm for some reason.

00:06:53.875 --> 00:06:58.313
When she makes it snow,
everyone is happy to go outside.

00:06:58.313 --> 00:07:01.476
Everyone loves Mommy's snow.

00:07:03.051 --> 00:07:07.322
That's why I want to become
a Snow Fairy like her.

00:07:07.322 --> 00:07:11.053
I want to make snow that
will make everyone happy.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:14.295
Saga?

00:07:14.295 --> 00:07:16.092
Hey, Saga, are you listening?

00:07:16.464 --> 00:07:19.200
Huh? Oh. I'm sorry.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:20.963
You...

00:07:51.499 --> 00:07:54.662
Mommy. Hey, Mommy!

00:07:56.871 --> 00:07:59.066
What is it, Saga?

00:08:00.241 --> 00:08:01.876
Play this.

00:08:01.876 --> 00:08:05.869
I will later, Saga.
Mommy's working right now.

00:08:06.214 --> 00:08:09.047
No! I want to hear this!

00:08:09.551 --> 00:08:12.782
I guess I'll have to.
Well, just a little, okay?

00:08:20.929 --> 00:08:22.487
Waffo!

00:08:22.997 --> 00:08:26.455
I did it... I did magic...

00:08:33.274 --> 00:08:34.764
I'm going now!

00:08:44.986 --> 00:08:48.285
I like your apple pie best, Mommy.

00:08:48.389 --> 00:08:53.761
Okay, okay. If you help
me out, I'll make some.

00:08:53.761 --> 00:08:55.422
I will!

00:08:57.232 --> 00:09:00.802
What do you think, Saga?
Have I gotten a little bit better?

00:09:00.802 --> 00:09:02.871
Why are you asking me?

00:09:02.871 --> 00:09:07.308
Because you should know
if I got better or not.

00:09:07.308 --> 00:09:09.444
You've been listening
to me since yesterday.

00:09:09.444 --> 00:09:12.311
C'mon, I'll play it again.

00:09:17.218 --> 00:09:18.913
Waffo! I did it!

00:09:26.094 --> 00:09:27.795
I think I need more practice.

00:09:27.795 --> 00:09:32.500
It's your choice to practice or not,
but don't involve me, okay?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:36.630
W-Wait a minute! C'mon, Saga!

00:09:41.242 --> 00:09:43.478
Saga, what'll we do?

00:09:43.478 --> 00:09:46.848
I completely forgot that we have
a pommel horse test today!

00:09:46.848 --> 00:09:50.285
Maybe we should practice
while we still can.

00:09:50.285 --> 00:09:52.186
Hey! Hey! Have I gotten better?

00:09:52.186 --> 00:09:55.657
Yeesh. Knock it off! You don't
have to bug me at school, too.

00:09:55.657 --> 00:10:01.687
But I have to practice! I want to
become a Snow Fairy like my Mommy!!

00:10:03.398 --> 00:10:05.696
Oh, my! Miss Saga! Move!

00:10:06.601 --> 00:10:08.569
Pretty jump!

00:10:09.604 --> 00:10:10.935
Ow!

00:10:13.741 --> 00:10:16.676
That didn't count.
Wait till the real test!

00:10:16.945 --> 00:10:19.709
I wonder what Greta wanted to do?

00:10:24.652 --> 00:10:26.745
Pretty jump...

00:10:30.191 --> 00:10:34.028
Hey! Hey! How was it this time?
Have I gotten better?

00:10:34.028 --> 00:10:38.260
Be quiet! Yeesh! If you're going
to practice, do it somewhere else!

00:10:39.701 --> 00:10:42.295
Are you saying that my practicing
is unflattering to the eye?

00:10:42.437 --> 00:10:45.201
Huh? Uh, n-no.
I wasn't talking about you, Greta.

00:10:46.441 --> 00:10:50.741
Very well. If you insist,
I'll practice outside.

00:10:51.145 --> 00:10:56.551
But you'll see. Once class starts,
I'll blow you away with my skill!

00:10:56.551 --> 00:11:00.355
Once class has started,
you can't go outside, Greta.

00:11:00.355 --> 00:11:01.788
Oh, yes...

00:11:03.891 --> 00:11:08.796
As I mentioned last week, today
we are having a pommel horse test.

00:11:08.796 --> 00:11:11.933
Fine! I'll go practice by myself!

00:11:11.933 --> 00:11:13.401
-Those who can't jump, please make
the effort, and don't be embarrassed.

00:11:13.401 --> 00:11:15.937
-Humph to you!!
-Those who can't jump, please make
the effort, and don't be embarrassed.

00:11:15.937 --> 00:11:21.637
However, please be careful not to
go overboard and get hurt, okay?

00:11:30.618 --> 00:11:34.213
I'm exhausted. This is hard work.

00:11:34.722 --> 00:11:38.681
If you don't shape up, you won't become
a proud Snow Fairy like your mother!

00:11:40.261 --> 00:11:42.752
That's right. I have to keep on trying!

00:11:47.168 --> 00:11:49.466
I got it!!

00:11:55.243 --> 00:11:57.711
That was close...

00:12:00.314 --> 00:12:01.781
Caw?

00:12:03.217 --> 00:12:04.684
Waffo?!

00:12:06.087 --> 00:12:08.555
It was an accident!

00:12:10.725 --> 00:12:12.693
Thank you. Come again!

00:12:16.731 --> 00:12:19.859
-Mommy.
-You are so spoiled!

00:12:20.301 --> 00:12:23.896
What's wrong with me? Okay...

00:12:27.141 --> 00:12:28.409
Welcome back.

00:12:28.409 --> 00:12:30.478
I'm home.

00:12:30.478 --> 00:12:31.877
Ooph!

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:34.348
Saga! Help!!

00:12:35.083 --> 00:12:36.550
What? Hey!

00:12:38.019 --> 00:12:39.486
Sugar!

00:12:43.157 --> 00:12:45.293
Saga, open the door!

00:12:45.293 --> 00:12:46.521
Right!

00:12:47.895 --> 00:12:49.692
H-Hey!

00:12:49.831 --> 00:12:51.298
Saga!!

00:12:55.169 --> 00:12:59.265
Get lost! Shoo! Shoo!
And don't come back!

00:13:03.144 --> 00:13:05.578
That was scary!

00:13:06.981 --> 00:13:11.619
Knock it off already!
Why don't you just leave me alone!

00:13:11.619 --> 00:13:14.222
I didn't mean to...

00:13:14.222 --> 00:13:18.124
You are! Look at this! I'm the
one who has to clean this up!

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:22.663
I was only practicing my magic.

00:13:22.663 --> 00:13:25.133
Joe chased me without asking!

00:13:25.133 --> 00:13:30.838
Oh, I see! But don't blame Joe for getting mad
for having to listen to your sour music.

00:13:30.838 --> 00:13:33.068
What do you mean?

00:13:35.877 --> 00:13:40.848
I want to become good at magic!
That's why I'm practicing!

00:13:40.848 --> 00:13:42.216
I don't care.

00:13:42.216 --> 00:13:47.388
I'm going to do lots and lots of practicing to
become a full-fledged Season Fairy soon!

00:13:47.388 --> 00:13:48.489
I can't hear you.

00:13:48.489 --> 00:13:52.858
I'm going to become a proud
Snow Fairy just like my Mommy!!

00:13:53.327 --> 00:13:55.261
That has nothing to do with me!!

00:13:58.432 --> 00:14:03.237
Dear, dear. What a disaster.
Oh, thanks, Saga.

00:14:03.237 --> 00:14:05.000
Stupid Saga!

00:14:20.521 --> 00:14:24.719
That Sugar... I won't let her
get away with it this time.

00:14:25.459 --> 00:14:27.261
Is something wrong?

00:14:27.261 --> 00:14:28.329
Huh?

00:14:28.329 --> 00:14:32.732
You're making faces.
Did you have a fight with a friend?

00:14:32.867 --> 00:14:35.495
N-No. It's nothing.

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:40.297
I see. Your tea has gotten cold.
Shall I make you a fresh cup?

00:14:40.474 --> 00:14:42.840
It's fine, Grandma.

00:14:44.111 --> 00:14:45.806
It's good.

00:14:46.147 --> 00:14:49.083
Wow. Saga said that?

00:14:49.083 --> 00:14:52.186
Isn't it mean? Isn't it?
Don't you think it's mean?

00:14:52.186 --> 00:14:57.658
Actually... You know. Didn't you
make her mad enough to say that?

00:14:57.658 --> 00:14:58.459
Huh?

00:14:58.459 --> 00:15:02.263
I think you should apologize
quickly and make up.

00:15:02.263 --> 00:15:04.232
Wh-Why should I?

00:15:04.232 --> 00:15:09.534
Even if you didn't mean to do it, it's
true that you made trouble for the store.

00:15:09.704 --> 00:15:13.606
I'm sure you don't feel good about
fighting with Saga and not making up.

00:15:14.575 --> 00:15:16.509
You're wrong!

00:15:24.318 --> 00:15:26.684
That has nothing to do with me!!

00:15:27.688 --> 00:15:29.246
Stupid Saga!

00:15:33.394 --> 00:15:35.954
Maybe I was too harsh.

00:16:00.755 --> 00:16:02.790
S-Say, Sugar...

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:03.848
Hmm?

00:16:03.991 --> 00:16:08.429
A-About your mother...
What kind of person is she?

00:16:08.429 --> 00:16:12.661
Do you think I've seen
your mother's snow?

00:16:14.869 --> 00:16:17.394
That has nothing to do
with you, remember?

00:16:21.676 --> 00:16:23.778
S-Say, Saga?

00:16:23.778 --> 00:16:26.269
Okay! Homework! Homework!

00:16:57.812 --> 00:16:59.447
Did something happen?

00:16:59.447 --> 00:17:00.381
Huh?

00:17:00.381 --> 00:17:03.217
Your playing sounds
different than usual.

00:17:03.217 --> 00:17:04.952
R-Really?

00:17:04.952 --> 00:17:08.945
Yeah... It doesn't
sound like you. Well...

00:17:09.323 --> 00:17:11.559
Are you worried about something?

00:17:11.559 --> 00:17:13.527
N-Not me.

00:17:25.573 --> 00:17:28.098
Ginger!

00:17:28.576 --> 00:17:30.845
No, I'll stop being so informal.

00:17:30.845 --> 00:17:34.348
Yes! Ginger... How are you?

00:17:34.348 --> 00:17:35.983
I am fine.

00:17:35.983 --> 00:17:39.854
You are a pretty girl.
I am an old man.

00:17:39.854 --> 00:17:42.789
Argh! What am I doing?

00:17:47.628 --> 00:17:49.663
I thought that I could get somewhere...

00:17:49.663 --> 00:17:52.833
...if I wrote in a letter the feelings
I can't say to her face...

00:17:52.833 --> 00:17:57.793
...but it's an uphill battle
without even writing a single love letter.

00:17:58.105 --> 00:18:00.007
I am so naive.

00:18:00.007 --> 00:18:02.339
What's a love letter?

00:18:02.777 --> 00:18:05.245
Sugar! What do you want?

00:18:05.379 --> 00:18:08.610
Um, I, uh...

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:11.886
What's this?

00:18:11.886 --> 00:18:16.357
Don't!! This is a letter!
Just an ordinary letter!

00:18:16.357 --> 00:18:19.660
I'm not trying to tell her the secret feelings...

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.929
...I have deep inside for her!!

00:18:21.929 --> 00:18:23.487
A letter?

00:18:23.831 --> 00:18:25.866
A-ha! That's it!

00:18:25.866 --> 00:18:27.935
Huh? Where?

00:18:27.935 --> 00:18:32.304
Waffo! You're awesome,
Elder! Thank you!

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:33.907
Smoo...

00:18:35.109 --> 00:18:36.406
Waffo!

00:18:37.211 --> 00:18:39.113
I'm home.

00:18:39.113 --> 00:18:41.148
Hello, Saga.

00:18:41.148 --> 00:18:42.716
Is there something I can help with?

00:18:42.716 --> 00:18:45.276
Okay, will you set the table?

00:18:45.419 --> 00:18:46.886
Sure!

00:18:49.356 --> 00:18:51.381
This is my chance!

00:18:54.829 --> 00:18:57.264
-Saga?
-What?

00:18:57.264 --> 00:18:59.767
Were you thinking about your mother?

00:18:59.767 --> 00:19:00.835
Huh?

00:19:00.835 --> 00:19:05.704
Oh, you know.
I saw the sheet music on your desk, so I thought...

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:09.109
Oh, that. Yeah, a little.

00:19:09.243 --> 00:19:11.278
Uh, it's not what you think.

00:19:11.278 --> 00:19:15.612
I wasn't getting sad or
anything. I just got it out.

00:19:16.417 --> 00:19:20.254
I understand.
You felt like playing it, right?

00:19:20.254 --> 00:19:21.881
Yeah.

00:19:28.395 --> 00:19:29.362
Oof!

00:19:30.898 --> 00:19:34.265
I... If I don't hurry, Saga will come.

00:19:34.735 --> 00:19:36.532
A-ha!

00:19:41.775 --> 00:19:43.477
I'll try my best!

00:19:43.477 --> 00:19:46.969
That song was your
special favorite, wasn't it?

00:19:47.114 --> 00:19:50.751
You always made your
mother play it for you.

00:19:50.751 --> 00:19:52.218
Yeah.

00:19:54.722 --> 00:19:57.657
Hey, Mommy. Play this! Play this!

00:19:59.393 --> 00:20:02.191
Alright, sweetheart.
Just a little, okay?

00:20:28.055 --> 00:20:30.224
Maybe I'll play it for her.

00:20:30.224 --> 00:20:32.920
Did you say something?

00:20:33.861 --> 00:20:37.490
No, it's nothing. Thank you.

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:53.241
...rry, fr... om...

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:55.712
Su...

00:20:55.783 --> 00:20:58.752
...gar.

00:20:58.752 --> 00:21:00.310
Did it!

00:21:01.589 --> 00:21:03.648
I'm pooped!

00:21:05.259 --> 00:21:06.460
Huh?

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:09.054
Oh, S-Saga!

00:21:09.296 --> 00:21:12.333
Oh... this?

00:21:12.333 --> 00:21:14.324
L-Listen.

00:21:17.571 --> 00:21:21.371
Th-That's... Um...

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:34.087
Get out.

00:21:35.322 --> 00:21:36.357
Saga?

00:21:36.357 --> 00:21:37.915
Get out, now!

00:21:39.193 --> 00:21:41.528
What's wrong, Saga? Why?

00:21:41.528 --> 00:21:43.086
Shut up!

00:21:44.832 --> 00:21:46.663
Get out.

00:21:47.368 --> 00:21:50.337
I don't want to see
your face ever again.

00:21:50.337 --> 00:21:51.804
Huh?

00:22:05.452 --> 00:22:08.319
Stupid Saga!!

00:22:20.801 --> 00:22:25.272
Tsuki no negai

00:22:25.272 --> 00:22:28.776
Mizu ni tokete

00:22:28.776 --> 00:22:34.281
Shiroi namiki-michi mitsuketa

00:22:34.281 --> 00:22:38.775
Hoshi-kuzu no uta

00:22:38.986 --> 00:22:47.294
Nana-iro no hashi o wataru kaze

00:22:47.294 --> 00:22:52.633
Shitte ita yo ne

00:22:52.633 --> 00:22:57.604
Kimochi tsunagu ureshisa

00:22:57.604 --> 00:22:59.435
Sugar Snow

00:22:59.707 --> 00:23:07.781
Kona-yuki mau machi ni yagate

00:23:07.781 --> 00:23:13.151
Kirei na hana saku kisetsu ni

00:23:13.287 --> 00:23:18.122
Anata o omou

00:23:19.493 --> 00:23:24.157
Kokoro o tokasu

00:23:24.298 --> 00:23:28.268
ai wa, yume wa

00:23:28.268 --> 00:23:35.197
sono mune ni aruno

00:23:40.714 --> 00:23:44.251
Preview of the Next Episode
I hate her! I hate her!
I hate her! I hate Saga!!

00:23:44.251 --> 00:23:48.188
I'll never apologize to her!
Even if she gives me lots of waffles...

00:23:48.188 --> 00:23:52.793
...or takes me shopping, or doesn't make
me shampoo...

00:23:52.793 --> 00:23:55.929
Hey! Are you listening
to me, Saga?

00:23:55.929 --> 00:24:00.367
Oh, yeah. I ran away
from home, didn't I?

00:24:00.367 --> 00:24:04.371
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The next episode is
"Heart Joining Melody"

00:24:04.371 --> 00:24:09.001
I've decided I'm going
to become a bad girl!
